# an exclusive aspect does not apply a concurrent aspect: only the primary aspect calls one (D-206)
** spec: semantics/multitasking.md#where-a-group-is-allowed
primary aspect d48_exclusive_calls_concurrent is
  process main is
    apply helper();
  return;
end d48_exclusive_calls_concurrent;
